  <p>
    The Cloud Native Community in Abuja, Nigeria hosted its first (virtual)
    meetup for the year on January 31, 2025.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Abuja-based community group was established in 2024, making it one of
    Africa's eight Cloud Native Community Groups under the Cloud Native
    Computing Foundation (CNCF), with a member strength of fifty. The
    organizing team began the year with another online meetup themed{' '}
    <strong>Cloud-Native Unplugged</strong>.
  </p>
